WEBVTT

00:04:59.768 --> 00:05:03.365
that's dipping in and out of the condensation layer?

00:05:03.365 --> 00:05:06.198
What if every seemingly isolated object

00:05:06.198 --> 00:05:10.042
was actually just where the continuous wave of that object

00:05:10.042 --> 00:05:13.523
poked through into our world?

00:05:13.523 --> 00:05:17.900
The Earth is neither flat nor round.

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:22.323
It's wavy.

00:05:22.323 --> 00:05:27.821
It sounds good, but I'll bet you know in your gut that it's not the whole truth,

00:05:27.821 --> 00:05:29.379
and I'll tell you why.

00:05:29.379 --> 00:05:31.375
I have a two-year-old daughter who's the best thing ever.